<title>SPAIN: Spain's Telefonica to buy stake in Antena 3 TV.</title>
<headline>Spain's Telefonica to buy stake in Antena 3 TV.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish telecommunications firm Telefonica de Espana said on Wednesday it would buy a stake in private television station Antena 3.</p>
<p>&quot;Telefonica has decided to buy a stake in Antena 3 television,&quot; a company spokesman told Reuters.</p>
<p>He would not immediately say how big the stake would be.  </p>
<p>Local media reports said Telefonica would buy a 25 percent stake in the commercial television channel.</p>
<p>Antena 3 is part of a joint venture which controls almost all of the rights to Spain's lucrative soccer broadcasts.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom + 341 585 2160</p>
